                                "sense_id": "fe8ad371-66ce-34e3-a734-2f7fae61b663",
                                "text": "He was “great” (as he expressed it) with the Bloomer who kept the bar where their club was held, and whom he styled “a spiffy girl,” and who had been graciously pleased to accept of a pair of very Brummagem-looking earrings, set with paste diamonds, with which he had presented her."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
